      "message": "I see the same behavior as Jordan locally:\n\n```\n[ct] ~/a/a/p/m/B/s/g/hci [ 40ms ] ((gbiv/repo)) 1 ~\u003e clang-format -i hci_layer.cc \u0026\u0026 git diff | grep move\n[ct] ~/a/a/p/m/B/s/g/hci [ 60ms ] ((gbiv/repo)) 1 ~\u003e\n```\n\n`clang-tidy --dump-config` inside of `packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/gd/hci` for me notes that `ColumnLimit` is determined to be 120. `strace` says this is coming from gd\u0027s .clang-format, which explicitly asks for a column limit of 120. Changing this to 100 seems best unless we\u0027d rather modify the lint: https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Bluetooth/+/2094109",
